{
  "chapter": 10,
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "E10.1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "采用稳定极点与校正零点相消的设计，取 $a=2$，开环及闭环化为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "L(s)=\\frac{K(s+2)}{s(s+2)}=\\frac Ks,\\qquad T(s)=\\frac K{s+K}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "该系统具有积分环节。对零初始条件下的单位阶跃，响应与稳态误差为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "y(t)=1-e^{-Kt},\\qquad e_{\\mathrm{ss}}=0,\\qquad \\mathrm{P.O.}=0"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "按2%准则，误差进入稳态带的时刻满足 $e^{-KT_s}=0.02$，故可取："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "a=2,\\qquad K=\\ln50=3.912023,\\qquad T_s=\\frac{\\ln50}{K}=1\\ \\mathrm{s}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "所得响应单调上升，超调量满足不大于5%的要求。相消的对象极点为 $-2$，其内部模态稳定。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/E10_1_step.png",
          "caption": "PI校正后的单位阶跃响应：零稳态误差、零超调，2%调节时间为1 s。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'a': 2.0, 'K': 3.912023005428146, 'exact_Ts': 1.0, 'step': {'PI design': {'overshoot_pct': 0.0, 'settling_2pct': 1.0, 'peak_time': 2.5, 'rise_10_90': 0.561659419655372, 'rise_0_100': None}}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "E10.6",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "由单位负反馈关系得闭环传递函数："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "T(s)=\\frac{10s+40}{s(s+0.2)(s^2+15s+150)+10(s+4)}=\\frac{10s+40}{s^4+15.2s^3+153s^2+40s+40}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "闭环极点分为两组共轭对。靠近虚轴的一组决定主要衰减振荡："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "s_{1,2}=-0.1206649\\pm0.5036637j,\\qquad s_{3,4}=-7.479335\\pm9.653048j"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\omega_n\\approx0.517916\\ \\mathrm{rad/s},\\qquad \\zeta\\approx0.232982"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "采用主导极点的标准二阶近似，得到："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\mathrm{P.O.}\\approx100e^{-\\pi\\zeta/\\sqrt{1-\\zeta^2}}=47.1119\\%,\\qquad T_s\\approx\\frac4{\\zeta\\omega_n}=33.1497\\ \\mathrm{s}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "完整四阶模型的实际计算为超调47.5439%、2%调节时间32.136 s，与题给47.5%、32.1 s一致。以题给47.5%和32.1 s为比较基准，超调估计低约0.39个百分点，调节时间估计高约1.05 s。闭环零点 $-4$ 及远端极点改变响应的振荡幅值和相位；$4/(\\zeta\\omega_n)$ 依据指数包络估算，而实际调节时间取最后一次进入2%带的时刻，因此出现上述小幅偏差。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/E10_6_step.png",
          "caption": "完整四阶闭环的单位阶跃响应及2%稳态带。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'closed_numerator': [10, 40], 'closed_denominator': [1, 15.2, 153, 40, 40], 'poles': [[-7.479335108304176, 9.653048045638903], [-7.479335108304176, -9.653048045638903], [-0.12066489169581922, 0.5036636844030415], [-0.12066489169581922, -0.5036636844030415]], 'dominant_zeta': 0.23298152635289512, 'dominant_wn': 0.5179161351748084, 'estimate_overshoot_pct': 47.11188094840796, 'estimate_settling': 33.14965889236025, 'step': {'Full fourth-order model': {'overshoot_pct': 47.54392280934348, 'settling_2pct': 32.135999999999996, 'peak_time': 6.08075, 'rise_10_90': 2.35849903094393, 'rise_0_100': 3.429242964327377}}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "E10.9",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "由速度误差常数要求，首先确定积分增益："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "L(s)=\\frac{K_Ps+K_I}{s(s+1)},\\quad K_v=\\lim_{s\\to0}sL(s)=K_I=5,\\quad T(s)=\\frac{K_Ps+5}{s^2+(1+K_P)s+5}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "闭环分子包含零点，按完整二阶传递函数确定超调。令 $\\sigma=(1+K_P)/2$、$\\omega_d=\\sqrt{5-\\sigma^2}$，零初始条件的阶跃误差为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "e(t)=e^{-\\sigma t}\\left[\\cos(\\omega_dt)+\\frac{1-\\sigma}{\\omega_d}\\sin(\\omega_dt)\\right]"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "由首峰处导数为零，并要求该峰值为1.05，联合求解得到："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\dot y(t_p)=e^{-\\sigma t_p}\\left[K_P\\cos(\\omega_dt_p)+\\frac{5+\\sigma-2\\sigma^2}{\\omega_d}\\sin(\\omega_dt_p)\\right]=0,\\qquad e(t_p)=-0.05"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "K_P=3.044974,\\qquad K_I=5,\\qquad t_p\\approx1.2492\\ \\mathrm{s}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "所得闭环极点约为 $-2.022487\\pm0.953702j$。实际阶跃计算给出超调5.0000%，速度误差常数精确为5，单位斜坡稳态误差为0.2；两项设计指标均满足。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/E10_9_step.png",
          "caption": "按完整PI闭环零点设计后的单位阶跃响应，超调为5%。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'Kp': 3.044974099495769, 'Ki': 5.0, 'Kv': 5.0, 'poles': [[-2.0224870497478844, 0.9537012811158943], [-2.0224870497478844, -0.9537012811158943]], 'step': {'PI design': {'overshoot_pct': 4.999999767630747, 'settling_2pct': 2.0976, 'peak_time': 1.2492, 'rise_10_90': 0.5280960612436056, 'rise_0_100': 0.7870441239328446}}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P10.1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "令归一化输出为 $z=K_1y$，并取 $J,K_1,K_2>0$。这样闭环稳态增益为1，设计环路写为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "L(s)=\\frac{K_1K_2G_c(s)}{Js^2}=\\frac{A(s+z_0)}{s^2(s+p)},\\qquad G_c(s)=\\frac{AJ}{K_1K_2}\\frac{s+z_0}{s+p},\\quad p>z_0>0"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "选择主导复极点 $s_d=-2.4\\pm3.2j$，则 $\\omega_n=4\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}$、$\\zeta=0.6$，包络估计 $T_s\\approx4/2.4=1.6667\\ \\mathrm{s}$。完整响应再按2%带校核。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "伯德图法：以超前零极点及增益调节穿越频率和相角，同时用完整闭环极点校核阻尼。取高频极点 $p=24.8$，相角与幅值条件为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\phi_m=\\arctan\\frac{\\omega_c}{z_0}-\\arctan\\frac{\\omega_c}{p},\\qquad \\frac{A\\sqrt{\\omega_c^2+z_0^2}}{\\omega_c^2\\sqrt{\\omega_c^2+p^2}}=1"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "选取 $\\omega_c=5.076889\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}$、$\\phi_m=49.06095^\\circ$，由幅相条件得 $z_0=20/7$、$A=112$。该选择的完整闭环复极点阻尼恰为0.6，具体校正器为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "G_{c,B}(s)=\\frac{112J}{K_1K_2}\\frac{s+2.857143}{s+24.8},\\qquad D_B(s)=(s+20)(s^2+4.8s+16)"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "根轨迹法：取第三极点 $-12$，由目标特征多项式配系数得："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "(s+12)(s^2+4.8s+16)=s^3+16.8s^2+73.6s+192"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "p=16.8,\\qquad A=73.6,\\qquad z_0=\\frac{192}{73.6}=2.608696,\\qquad G_{c,R}(s)=\\frac{73.6J}{K_1K_2}\\frac{s+2.608696}{s+16.8}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "在 $s_d$ 处，这一开环满足根轨迹相角条件 $\\arg L(s_d)=(2k+1)\\pi$ 和幅值条件 $|L(s_d)|=1$。两种设计的闭环主导极点均精确为 $-2.4\\pm3.2j$，第三极点分别为 $-20$ 与 $-12$。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/P10_1_bode.png",
          "caption": "两种超前设计的伯德图及穿越处相角特征。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/P10_1_rootlocus.png",
          "caption": "根轨迹设计的轨迹与所选闭环极点。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "完整模型的2%调节时间分别为1.8170 s与1.8684 s，均小于2.5 s。对应超调约30.59%与33.61%，反映超前零点对响应峰值的影响；题定阻尼指标由实际复极点核验。实际输出传递函数为归一化传递函数的 $1/K_1$ 倍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/P10_1_step.png",
          "caption": "归一化输出K1y的单位阶跃响应；两种设计均满足阻尼及调节时间要求。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'designs': [{'method': 'Bode design', 'p': 24.8, 'A': 112.0, 'z': 2.857142857142857, 'poles': [[-20.000000000000004, 0.0], [-2.4000000000000017, 3.199999999999999], [-2.4000000000000017, -3.199999999999999]], 'margin': [{'wc': 5.076888741637799, 'PM': 49.060947430169506}], 'frequency': {'Mr': 1.4497336040233875, 'wr': 3.374791494449168, 'bandwidth': 8.1018006914313}}, {'method': 'Root-locus design', 'p': 16.8, 'A': 73.6, 'z': 2.608695652173913, 'poles': [[-11.999999999999998, 0.0], [-2.3999999999999972, 3.1999999999999993], [-2.3999999999999972, -3.1999999999999993]], 'margin': [{'wc': 4.795627843435875, 'PM': 45.523360691374336}], 'frequency': {'Mr': 1.49531861246373, 'wr': 3.371169340479614, 'bandwidth': 7.931840369049378}}], 'step': {'Bode design': {'overshoot_pct': 30.592931702476722, 'settling_2pct': 1.8170000000000002, 'peak_time': 0.5914, 'rise_10_90': 0.21353538149777812, 'rise_0_100': 0.3013462894650366}, 'Root-locus design': {'overshoot_pct': 33.61232380126342, 'settling_2pct': 1.8684, 'peak_time': 0.611, 'rise_10_90': 0.22191798933058904, 'rise_0_100': 0.3174109168852622}}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P10.5",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "将放大器增益取为 $K_a=1$。选择PI控制器零点抵消对象的稳定慢极点 $-0.15$："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "G_c(s)=K_P+\\frac{K_I}{s}=K_P\\frac{s+0.15}{s},\\qquad K_I=0.15K_P"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "L(s)=\\frac{3.75K_P}{s(0.15s+1)},\\qquad T(s)=\\frac{25K_P}{s^2+(20/3)s+25K_P}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "由10%超调确定阻尼系数，并由一次项确定自然频率："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\zeta=\\frac{-\\ln0.1}{\\sqrt{\\pi^2+\\ln^2 0.1}}=0.591155,\\qquad \\zeta\\omega_n=\\frac{10}{3},\\quad \\omega_n=5.638679\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "K_P=\\frac{\\omega_n^2}{25}=1.271788,\\qquad K_I=0.190768,\\qquad K_a=1"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "闭环具有积分作用，故单位阶跃稳态误差为零。超调的解析值为10%，调节时间包络估计为1.2 s；完整响应最后进入2%带的时刻为1.05105 s，满足不大于1.5 s的要求。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/P10_5_step.png",
          "caption": "PI校正后的转台单位阶跃响应及2%稳态带。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'Ka': 1.0, 'Kp': 1.2717879266323364, 'Ki': 0.19076818899485046, 'zeta': 0.5911550337988976, 'wn': 5.638678760650265, 'estimate_settling': 1.2, 'step': {'PI design': {'overshoot_pct': 9.999999896392907, 'settling_2pct': 1.0510499999999998, 'peak_time': 0.69075, 'rise_10_90': 0.3250527873182843, 'rise_0_100': 0.4844601412375626}}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P10.13",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "(a) 对比例控制器，相角裕度随穿越频率变化为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\phi_m=90^\\circ-\\arctan\\omega_c-\\arctan\\frac{\\omega_c}{2}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "令相角裕度为50°，由 $\\arctan\\omega_c+\\arctan(\\omega_c/2)=40^\\circ$，并联立幅值条件得："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\omega_c=0.4917604\\ \\mathrm{rad/s},\\qquad K=\\frac{\\omega_c\\sqrt{1+\\omega_c^2}\\sqrt{4+\\omega_c^2}}{4}=0.2821635"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "T_a(s)=\\frac{4K}{s^3+3s^2+2s+4K},\\qquad |T_a(j\\omega_B)|=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\omega_B=0.8764068\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "(b) 要求 $K_v=\\lim_{s\\to0}sG_c(s)G(s)=2G_c(0)=2$，故滞后控制器的直流增益取1。令零点频率为 $z=0.05\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}$，由幅相条件联合求极点和穿越频率："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "G_c(s)=\\frac{1+s/0.05}{1+s/p},\\qquad |G_c(j\\omega_c)G(j\\omega_c)|=1,\\quad \\arg[G_c(j\\omega_c)G(j\\omega_c)]=-130^\\circ"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "p=0.01164108\\ \\mathrm{rad/s},\\qquad \\omega_c=0.4224480\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "因此可采用上述滞后校正器。其 $K_v=2$、相角裕度50.0000°，闭环极点均在左半平面；3 dB带宽为 $0.7638583\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}$。低频增益的提高改善斜坡跟踪精度，同时较低穿越频率保持所要求的相角裕度。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/P10_13_bode.png",
          "caption": "比例控制与滞后校正的伯德图，二者相角裕度均为50°。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'part_a': {'K': 0.2821635355160197, 'wc': 0.4917604085121741, 'margin': [{'wc': 0.49176040851216996, 'PM': 50.00000000000031}], 'Mr': 1.1840006465972686, 'wr': 0.5072742848202464, 'bandwidth': 0.8764068064101262}, 'part_b': {'lag_zero': 0.05, 'lag_pole': 0.011641082547428077, 'Kv': 2.0, 'margin': [{'wc': 0.4224479892601857, 'PM': 50.000000000000796}], 'poles': [[-2.3045762105524594, 0.0], [-0.32621267157630196, 0.5132011729075943], [-0.32621267157630196, -0.5132011729075943], [-0.054639528842367134, 0.0]], 'Mr': 1.1880937650622214, 'wr': 0.38455842014727243, 'bandwidth': 0.7638583386598405, 'residual': [9.992007221626358e-15, 1.554312234475219e-14]}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P10.19",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "(a) 保留 $T=0.5\\ \\mathrm{s}$ 的纯时延，选择适当的保守增益 $K=1$。闭环及单位阶跃稳态误差为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "T_a(s)=\\frac{e^{-0.5s}}{(s+1)(s+3)+e^{-0.5s}},\\qquad e_{\\mathrm{ss},a}=\\frac1{1+K/3}=\\frac34=75\\%"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "对零历史状态的单位阶跃进行纯时延模型求解，稳态输出为0.25，相对该稳态值的超调为1.1146%，2%调节时间约2.620 s，满足超调不大于30%的要求。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "(b) 保持同一 $K=1$，要求校正后单位阶跃误差小于12%，由直流环路增益得："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "e_{\\mathrm{ss},b}=\\frac1{1+2/(3b)}=\\frac{3b}{3b+2}<0.12\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad 0<b<\\frac1{11}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "选择 $b=1/15$，得到滞后控制器和闭环传递函数："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "G_c(s)=\\frac{s+2}{s+1/15},\\qquad T_b(s)=\\frac{(s+2)e^{-0.5s}}{(s+1/15)(s+1)(s+3)+(s+2)e^{-0.5s}}"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "y_{\\infty,b}=\\frac{10}{11}=0.909091,\\qquad e_{\\mathrm{ss},b}=\\frac1{11}=9.09091\\%<12\\%"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "实际纯时延响应给出超调约18.6289%、2%调节时间约9.855 s。校正后稳态输出从0.25提高到0.909091，显著改善参考跟踪精度；低频增益的增加使调节过程延长，超调仍保持在30%以内。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/P10_19_step.png",
          "caption": "K=1固定时，校正前与b=1/15滞后校正后的纯时延阶跃响应。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'part_a': {'K': 1.0, 'final': 0.25, 'steady_error': 0.75, 'overshoot_pct': 1.1145864030198238, 'settling_2pct': 2.62, 'peak_time': 3.48, 'rise_10_90': 1.3847105066326024, 'rise_0_100': 2.8956441456117203}, 'part_b': {'K': 1.0, 'b': 0.06666666666666667, 'final': 0.9090909090909091, 'steady_error': 0.09090909090909094, 'overshoot_pct': 18.62891966207121, 'settling_2pct': 9.856, 'peak_time': 4.47, 'rise_10_90': 1.7664550382437367, 'rise_0_100': 3.0666790032386437}, 'lag_trials': [{'b': 0.05, 'steady_error': 0.06976744186046513, 'overshoot_pct': 18.955311079842495, 'settling_2pct': 9.992, 'peak_time': 4.508, 'rise_10_90': 1.7801977307444639, 'rise_0_100': 3.085994898387117}, {'b': 0.08, 'steady_error': 0.1071428571428572, 'overshoot_pct': 18.37190011038874, 'settling_2pct': 9.748, 'peak_time': 4.44, 'rise_10_90': 1.7558595252391103, 'rise_0_100': 3.051224793726105}, {'b': 0.1, 'steady_error': 0.13043478260869557, 'overshoot_pct': 17.993006052104477, 'settling_2pct': 9.592, 'peak_time': 4.396, 'rise_10_90': 1.740578900061569, 'rise_0_100': 3.029481301899898}, {'b': 0.15, 'steady_error': 0.1836734693877552, 'overshoot_pct': 17.07927274370671, 'settling_2pct': 9.208, 'peak_time': 4.296, 'rise_10_90': 1.705357817140686, 'rise_0_100': 2.9796300018838613}, {'b': 0.2, 'steady_error': 0.23076923076923084, 'overshoot_pct': 16.21081039751129, 'settling_2pct': 8.828, 'peak_time': 4.204, 'rise_10_90': 1.6738725365698341, 'rise_0_100': 2.9354797927221914}, {'b': 0.25, 'steady_error': 0.2727272727272727, 'overshoot_pct': 15.38464676875073, 'settling_2pct': 8.42, 'peak_time': 4.124, 'rise_10_90': 1.6455999831366546, 'rise_0_100': 2.8962583907609987}, {'b': 0.3, 'steady_error': 0.31034482758620685, 'overshoot_pct': 14.597928302053841, 'settling_2pct': 6.144, 'peak_time': 4.0520000000000005, 'rise_10_90': 1.6201136547786659, 'rise_0_100': 2.861344753652057}, {'b': 0.4, 'steady_error': 0.375, 'overshoot_pct': 13.132969549332895, 'settling_2pct': 5.912, 'peak_time': 3.924, 'rise_10_90': 1.5761554867100889, 'rise_0_100': 2.8024822259239075}, {'b': 0.5, 'steady_error': 0.4285714285714286, 'overshoot_pct': 11.798121029231524, 'settling_2pct': 5.708, 'peak_time': 3.8160000000000003, 'rise_10_90': 1.5398327848335285, 'rise_0_100': 2.7557755417909524}, {'b': 0.6, 'steady_error': 0.4736842105263158, 'overshoot_pct': 10.578444140527509, 'settling_2pct': 5.5200000000000005, 'peak_time': 3.724, 'rise_10_90': 1.5096117575672603, 'rise_0_100': 2.7190526449863053}], 'step_convergence': [{'h': 0.004, 'final': 0.9090909090909091, 'overshoot_pct': 18.62892937283156, 'settling_2pct': 9.856, 'peak_time': 4.468, 'rise_10_90': 1.7664576789907576, 'rise_0_100': 3.0663474324331}, {'h': 0.002, 'final': 0.9090909090909091, 'overshoot_pct': 18.62891966207121, 'settling_2pct': 9.856, 'peak_time': 4.47, 'rise_10_90': 1.7664550382437367, 'rise_0_100': 3.0666790032386437}, {'h': 0.001, 'final': 0.9090909090909091, 'overshoot_pct': 18.62892124404294, 'settling_2pct': 9.855, 'peak_time': 4.469, 'rise_10_90': 1.7664543769709606, 'rise_0_100': 3.066845220527453}], 'uncompensated_K_for_30pct': 3.9767770509977307}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P10.20",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "将两个相同的一阶超前环节均取直流增益1。由速度误差常数首先确定 $K=20$："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "G_c(s)=\\left(\\frac{1+s/z}{1+s/p}\\right)^2,\\qquad K_v=\\lim_{s\\to0}sG_c(s)G(s)=K=20"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "选择设计穿越频率 $\\omega_c=10\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}$，使闭环带宽留有余量。未校正对象在该频率的相角为 $-227.72631^\\circ$，故两个环节共需提供92.72631°超前。"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\delta=46.363155^\\circ,\\qquad M=\\left|G(j\\omega_c)\\right|^{-1/2}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "令 $x=\\omega_c/z$、$y=\\omega_c/p$。每个环节在穿越频率应满足 $(1+jx)/(1+jy)=Me^{j\\delta}$，由实部和虚部分别得："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "y=\\frac{\\cos\\delta-1/M}{\\sin\\delta},\\qquad x=M(\\sin\\delta+y\\cos\\delta)"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "z=4.711840\\ \\mathrm{rad/s},\\qquad p=30.047487\\ \\mathrm{rad/s},\\qquad G_c(s)=\\left(\\frac{1+s/4.711840}{1+s/30.047487}\\right)^2"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "完整五阶闭环的计算结果为 $K_v=20$、$\\omega_c=10\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}$、相角裕度45.0000°，3 dB带宽 $\\omega_B=18.16473\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}\\ge4\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}$。所有闭环极点均在左半平面，三项指标满足。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/P10_20_bode.png",
          "caption": "串联两个相同超前环节前后的伯德图。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'K': 20.0, 'lead_zero': 4.7118403466025, 'lead_pole': 30.047486813098416, 'phase_each_deg': 46.36315549695312, 'margin': [{'wc': 9.999999999999995, 'PM': 44.99999999999997}], 'Kv': 20.0, 'Mr': 1.3086925465856747, 'wr': 9.54295991303298, 'bandwidth': 18.164730174746293, 'poles': [[-44.59893841872039, 0.0], [-6.835647979974923, 11.864038884607197], [-6.835647979974923, -11.864038884607197], [-4.912369623763293, 1.335376436147979], [-4.912369623763293, -1.335376436147979]]}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P10.22",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "给定超前—滞后校正器直流增益为1，故仍取 $K=20$ 满足速度误差常数。选择 $\\omega_c=3\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}$，由穿越处幅值为1、相角为 $-135^\\circ$ 两个方程确定参数。"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "L(s)=\\frac{20}{s(1+s/2)(1+s/6)}\\frac{(1+s/(10a))(1+s/b)}{(1+s/a)(1+s/(10b))}"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "|L(j3)|=1,\\qquad \\arg L(j3)=-135^\\circ"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "幅值方程使用各零极点幅值的乘积，相角方程使用各一阶环节反正切之差："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "90^\\circ-\\arctan\\frac32-\\arctan\\frac36+\\arctan\\frac3{10a}-\\arctan\\frac3a+\\arctan\\frac3b-\\arctan\\frac3{10b}=45^\\circ"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "a=0.10199737\\ \\mathrm{rad/s},\\qquad b=1.07097560\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "对应滞后极点、零点分别为0.10199737、1.01997370 rad/s，超前零点、极点分别为1.07097560、10.70975597 rad/s。"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "K_v=20,\\qquad \\mathrm{PM}=45.0000^\\circ,\\qquad \\omega_B=5.512007\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "完整闭环极点均位于左半平面，且 $2\\le\\omega_B\\le10\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}$。与只用双超前的方案相比，滞后环节降低中频增益，将带宽控制在指定范围内。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/P10_22_bode.png",
          "caption": "所设计超前—滞后校正器的伯德图。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'K': 20.0, 'a': 0.10199737042101098, 'b': 1.0709755968931778, 'Kv': 20.0, 'residual': [5.508926648188509e-13, 3.497202527569243e-12], 'margin': [{'wc': 3.000000000001386, 'PM': 45.00000000018622}], 'Mr': 1.307939545351515, 'wr': 3.1134492349451004, 'bandwidth': 5.512006643204475, 'poles': [[-13.234170775219386, 0.0], [-1.8489214922138595, 3.7793013404578977], [-1.8489214922138595, -3.7793013404578977], [-0.9398697898528461, 0.48553799982656337], [-0.9398697898528461, -0.48553799982656337]]}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P10.43",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "先由闭环稳定性确定有限稳态超调量的适用增益区间。闭环特征多项式为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "D(s)=s^4+4s^3+(5+K)s^2+(2+2K)s+20K"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "劳斯表首列为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "1,\\quad4,\\quad\\frac{K+9}{2},\\quad\\frac{2(K^2-70K+9)}{K+9},\\quad20K"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "对 $K>0$，稳定性由 $K^2-70K+9>0$ 决定。精确临界增益及稳定区间为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "K_-=35-4\\sqrt{76}=0.12880845,\\quad K_+=35+4\\sqrt{76}=69.87119155"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "0<K<K_-\\quad\\hbox{或}\\quad K_+<K\\le100"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "在这两个稳定区间内，由完整单位阶跃响应计算相对稳态值1的超调，所得变化曲线如下。低增益区的响应逐渐出现较弱阻尼振荡；高增益稳定区的超调仍较大，例如 $K=100$ 时约105.73%。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/P10_43_overshoot.png",
          "caption": "0<K≤100内的两个稳定超调分支，分别放大低增益区与高增益区；两者之间闭环不稳定。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "当 $K_-<K<K_+$ 时，劳斯首列有两次符号变化，闭环存在一对右半平面复极点，单位阶跃呈振幅增长的振荡。以 $K=10$ 为例："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "s=1.154536\\pm3.023578j,\\qquad s=-3.154536\\pm3.023578j"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "因此中间区间的响应持续发散，应以增长振荡描述，其稳态超调量无有限值。两个临界增益处具有虚轴共轭根，出现持续振荡。题面0.129与69.872是临界值的近似表示；按精确边界，上端极小区间 $69.87119155<K<69.872$ 已重新稳定。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'stable_lower_upper': 0.1288084516746082, 'stable_high_lower': 69.87119154832538, 'sample_poles': {'0.1': [[-1.9561393400569365, 0.6813240327513109], [-1.9561393400569365, -0.6813240327513109], [-0.04386065994306537, 0.681324032751312], [-0.04386065994306537, -0.681324032751312]], '1': [[-2.476295861868594, 1.4762958618685933], [-2.476295861868594, -1.4762958618685933], [0.47629586186859496, 1.4762958618685953], [0.47629586186859496, -1.4762958618685953]], '10': [[-3.154535768105304, 3.0235780750701835], [-3.154535768105304, -3.0235780750701835], [1.154535768105303, 3.0235780750701835], [1.154535768105303, -3.0235780750701835]], '40': [[-3.008494150374908, 4.851190446899626], [-3.008494150374908, -4.851190446899626], [1.008494150374906, 4.85119044689963], [1.008494150374906, -4.85119044689963]], '80': [[-0.9999999999999948, 6.770841068155762], [-0.9999999999999948, -6.770841068155762], [-1.0000000000000036, 5.758099619646679], [-1.0000000000000036, -5.758099619646679]], '100': [[-0.9999999999999987, 8.541510885755509], [-0.9999999999999987, -8.541510885755509], [-1.0000000000000007, 5.10319427305293], [-1.0000000000000007, -5.10319427305293]]}, 'endpoint_overshoots': [0, 88.92342844001692, 159.16189416432763, 105.7315224046334]}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AP10.4",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "由位置反馈及速度反馈相加，闭环传递函数为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "T(s)=\\frac{10K_1}{s(s+10)+10K_1(1+K_2s)}=\\frac{10K_1}{s^2+(10+10K_1K_2)s+10K_1}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "采用标准二阶配置，选取 $\\omega_n=8\\ \\mathrm{rad/s}$、$\\zeta=0.8$，则系数匹配得到："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "10K_1=64,\\qquad10+10K_1K_2=12.8\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad K_1=6.4,\\quad K_2=0.04375\\ \\mathrm{s}"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "T(s)=\\frac{64}{s^2+12.8s+64},\\qquad s=-6.4\\pm4.8j"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "由标准二阶响应，超调与调节时间估计为："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\mathrm{P.O.}=100e^{-\\pi(0.8)/\\sqrt{1-0.8^2}}=1.51646\\%<5\\%,\\qquad T_s\\approx\\frac4{0.8\\times8}=0.625\\ \\mathrm{s}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "完整阶跃响应最后进入2%带的时刻为0.4695 s，满足不大于1 s的要求。速度负反馈提高闭环阻尼，位置反馈保持单位稳态跟踪增益。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/AP10_4_step.png",
          "caption": "K1=6.4、K2=0.04375 s时的位置单位阶跃响应。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'K1': 6.4, 'K2': 0.04375, 'wn': 8.0, 'zeta': 0.8, 'estimate_settling': 0.625, 'step': {'Speed-feedback design': {'overshoot_pct': 1.5164619523194922, 'settling_2pct': 0.4695, 'peak_time': 0.6545249999999999, 'rise_10_90': 0.30843658623230497, 'rise_0_100': 0.5204357429166098}}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AP10.7",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "前置滤波器位于反馈环路之外，不改变闭环特征方程。由 $\\zeta=1/\\sqrt2$，将目标复极点写成 $s=-x\\pm jx$、$x>0$："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "D(s)=s(s+2)(s+8)(s+28)+K(s+3)=s^4+38s^3+296s^2+(448+K)s+3K"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "将 $s=-x+jx$ 代入特征方程，分别令实部、虚部为零并消去 $K$，得到："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "K=-76x^2+592x-448,\\qquad x^4-38x^3+205x^2-444x+336=0"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "x=1.62082994,\\qquad K=311.872509"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "所得闭环极点为 $-1.62082994\\pm1.62082994j$、$-6.24523777$ 和 $-28.51310234$，复根阻尼系数精确满足要求。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "(a) 分别计算无前置滤波 $G_p=1$ 和采用 $p=3$ 的两种情况。上升时间按首次从0到稳态值的时间计算，并同时给出10%—90%数值。"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "T_0(s)=\\frac{K(s+3)}{D(s)},\\qquad T_3(s)=\\frac{3K}{D(s)}"
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "\\begin{array}{c|ccc}\\hbox{情形}&\\mathrm{P.O.}&T_{r,0\\text{--}100}\\ (\\mathrm{s})&T_{r,10\\text{--}90}\\ (\\mathrm{s})\\\\\\hline G_p=1&6.60684\\%&1.16403&0.75488\\\\p=3&3.91770\\%&1.69886&1.00854\\end{array}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "$p=3$ 时，滤波器极点与闭环分子零点 $-3$ 相消，削弱了该零点对初期快速上升和峰值的作用。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "(b) 在所给一阶滤波器族中，令完整响应峰值为1.01，求得允许的较快滤波方案："
        },
        {
          "type": "eq",
          "latex": "p=1.8749511\\ \\mathrm{rad/s},\\qquad G_p(s)=\\frac{1.8749511}{s+1.8749511}"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "该方案的实际超调为1.0000%，0—100%上升时间约2.29454 s，10%—90%上升时间约1.25812 s。滤波降低超调并延缓上升；三种情况均保持单位直流增益及相同反馈环路极点。"
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "path": "figures/ch10/AP10_7_step.png",
          "caption": "无前置滤波、p=3及1%超调设计的单位阶跃响应比较。"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "{'K': 311.87250909010857, 'dominant_sigma': 1.6208299440057976, 'all_choices': [[311.87250909010857, 1.6208299440057976]], 'poles': [[-28.513102342694815, 0.0], [-6.245237769293593, 0.0], [-1.6208299440057972, 1.6208299440057976], [-1.6208299440057972, -1.6208299440057976]], 'p_for_1pct': 1.8749510588018097, 'step': {'No prefilter': {'overshoot_pct': 6.606840223717514, 'settling_2pct': 2.4909499999999998, 'peak_time': 1.6492, 'rise_10_90': 0.7548788942206696, 'rise_0_100': 1.1640341639083587}, 'Prefilter p=3': {'overshoot_pct': 3.9176983375773133, 'settling_2pct': 2.79825, 'peak_time': 2.1833, 'rise_10_90': 1.0085425046636496, 'rise_0_100': 1.6988612447572056}, 'Prefilter p=1.8750': {'overshoot_pct': 0.9999999240925872, 'settling_2pct': 2.07235, 'peak_time': 2.70865, 'rise_10_90': 1.2581158533618615, 'rise_0_100': 2.2945353218471394}}}"
      ]
    }
